          },
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You were born with a keen sense for magic, able to taste its unique effects in the air. You gain magicsense as a vague sense that has a range of 30 feet—like all vague senses, it's only about as precise as an average human's sense of smell, meaning you generally can predict only if magic is present; however, each tradition of magic has a unique taste to you, allowing you to identify the tradition of magic present.</p>"
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [
